OL,3,GNEWSANo sign of missing men after      
OL,4,Afishing boat Kilda recovered near      
OL,5,AOrkney                                 
OL,7,FPolice say there is no trace of two    
OL,8,Fmissing men after a fishing boat that  
OL,9,Fwent missing near the Isle of Lewis a  
OL,10,Fmonth ago was recovered near Orkney.   
OL,12,FThree men were on board the Kilda when 
OL,13,Fit disappeared on 13 October.          
OL,15,FThe body of crew member Douglas Craigie
OL,16,Fwas found by search teams the following
OL,17,Fday but two other men - Norman Murray  
OL,18,Fand Murdo Morrison - are still missing.
OL,23,APub: 20-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2 
